<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Nov car registrations down 13.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian Nov car registrations down 13.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian new car registrations fell 13.5 percent in November compared with the same month last year, the Belgian Automotive Industry Association, Febiac, said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    BELGIAN CAR REGISTRATIONS    NOV 96	 NOV 95</p>
<p>    Month				24,122	 27,895</p>
<p>    Cumulative Jan-Nov	    380,016	342,733</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
